WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.560
Starship’s first orbital flight will lift&nbsp;
off from Starbase in Boca Chica, Texas.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:09.480
The Starship spacecraft and Super Heavy booster&nbsp;
separate about three minutes into flight.

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:12.780
The booster comes down in the&nbsp;
Gulf of Mexico close to shore.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:17.580
While the upper stage continues on flying&nbsp;
between the Florida straits, and achieves orbit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:22.860
before splashing down in the Pacific Ocean&nbsp;
off the coast of the Hawaiian island of Kauai.

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.140
And we can’t wait to see this happen!

